r by contacting: Dr Cherie Zischke | Course Director and Lecturer in Physiotherapy | czischke@csu.edu.au | Ph: 02 6582 9465 Closing Date: 11pm, 15 October 2026 Advertised: 17 Sep 2026 09:00 AM - AUS Eastern Standard Time Applications close: 15 Oct 2026 11:00 PM - AUS Eastern Daylight Time Apply now Refer a friend Back to search results"
